SUMMARY:field:work Drawing With Code
DESCRIPTION:Get up-to-date information at: https://luma.com/mdkzw4jk\n\nAd
 dress:\nArts x Tech Lab\nPlease bring along a laptop (preferred) or a tabl
 et.\nSingapore\n\nAn afternoon translating the oldest art-school exercise.
 .. sitting in front of a still life and drawing what you see, but with cod
 e.\nWe'll set up an arrangement of physical objects in the Lab, then spend
  the session writing code-based responses to it. Instead of pencil and pap
 er, you'll have a tool that we've created for you. The question becomes: h
 ow can we see the world through algorithms? What does this medium abstract
  or exaggerate? What kind of picture emerges when a scene is described in 
 loops, coordinates, and rules rather than lines?\nThe workshop is less abo
 ut producing polished…\n\nHosted by jo+kapi ✦︎, Jo Ho & Kapilan Naid
 u
